												"icon": "outdent",
												"name": "WYSIWYG",
												"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
												"html": "<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Do not loiter in the front lobby. This area is closed during Cold Weather Shelter hours</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Pets – we all love our pets, but we cannot bring them to the shelter</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Enter or Exit only through the entrance</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>During these times: 6&nbsp;to 10 pm and 6 to 7 am</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Stay out of areas marked “Employee Only”</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Tv will be at the discretion of the Volunteer in Charge and only family-appropriate entertainment allowed</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Dinner is at 6:30 pm – Eat what you want while it is being served.</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>When everyone is served, the food will be put away and the kitchen cleaned. Food will not be available after that</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Water is the only beverage served after 8:30 pm</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>No Coffee will be brewed after 8:15 pm</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>Lights out from 10:00 pm to 6:00 am. This means you are to be lying down on your cot, cell phones on silent and everyone is quiet.</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>",
